  "created": "2026-11-11T23:16:11.507Z",
  "description": "Write Bevy games in C#. Mark a struct [Behavior], give it [OnUpdate] methods, and a\n            source generator registers it with the Bevy schedule as both a component and a system.\n            Bevy is the engine underneath, providing its ECS, scheduler, renderer and input\n            through a native bridge.",
